Built-Using: ffmpeg (= ${ffmpeg:Version})
Description: MJPEG video player for the WonderMedia WM8505
 wmt-play is a fullscreen video player for the WonderMedia WM8505,
 playing MJPEG AVI files.  The video hardware decodes each frame and
 scales it to the panel.
